# --------------------------------------------------------------------------- #
# Data  (~1.67 TB)
# --------------------------------------------------------------------------- #
# Everything under Data/ is either downloaded from a public source or
# regenerated by the Step_0 scripts, so none of it belongs in git. See
# CLAUDE.md "Data sources" for where each layer comes from.
#
# The one exception is the NLUM mask: it is 0.34 MB, it is the reference grid
# every other raster is matched to, and nothing in this repo can regenerate it.
# Git cannot re-include a file whose parent directory is still excluded, so the
# directory is un-excluded here; the file itself is re-included at the very
# BOTTOM of this file, after the broad *.tif rule that would otherwise win.
Data/*
!Data/NLUM_Mask/
Data/NLUM_Mask/*


# --------------------------------------------------------------------------- #
# Generated model artefacts
# --------------------------------------------------------------------------- #
# X_data.nc 874 MB, Y_data.nc 18 MB, random_forest_model.pkl 1.2 GB, plus the
# 16 prediction rasters - all rebuilt by Step_01 / Step_02 / Step_03.
Step_1_RF_for_FPI/data/
Step_1_RF_for_FPI/output/


# --------------------------------------------------------------------------- #
# Large binary formats, wherever they appear
# --------------------------------------------------------------------------- #
# Pickles are also version-fragile: an sklearn pickle rarely survives a library
# upgrade, so committing one gives a false sense of reproducibility.
*.pkl
*.tif
*.tiff
*.nc
*.zip
*.ovr
*.aux.xml
*.tfw

# Half-written output from an interrupted run
*.tmp
*.part


# --------------------------------------------------------------------------- #
# Python
# --------------------------------------------------------------------------- #
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*$py.class
*.so
.ipynb_checkpoints/
.pytest_cache/
.mypy_cache/
.ruff_cache/
.coverage
htmlcov/
build/
dist/
*.egg-info/

# Environments
.venv/
venv/
env/


# --------------------------------------------------------------------------- #
# Editors / OS / network-share detritus
# --------------------------------------------------------------------------- #
.vscode/
.idea/
*.swp
*~
Thumbs.db
ehthumbs.db
Desktop.ini
$RECYCLE.BIN/
*.c~
*.conda_trash
.~lock.*


# --------------------------------------------------------------------------- #
# Claude Code
# --------------------------------------------------------------------------- #
# Shared project settings are worth committing; machine-local overrides are not.
.claude/settings.local.json


# --------------------------------------------------------------------------- #
# Re-inclusions - MUST stay last
# --------------------------------------------------------------------------- #
# gitignore is last-match-wins, so a negation only survives if nothing below it
# re-excludes the path. The broad *.tif rule above would otherwise swallow the
# NLUM template. Verified with `git check-ignore -v`.
!Data/NLUM_Mask/NLUM_2010-11_mask.tif
